      "mergedPostDetails": "Mainly using VRCFury's World Collider prefab, but my avatars that did it manually also don't work (update: another friend who does it manually still has it working, not sure why)\n\nI have one moved to my muzzle and it no longer works in the open beta. My 'sacrificed' fingers are still gone, but they aren't moved anywhere.\n\nI know this was never officially supported, but I know a good 30% of VRC staff are furries who will understand my plight.\n\nMy avatar that has them working in live but not beta: avtr_576235d9-656a-41fa-a0f1-046bfe0f9b1e",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1602] Moved finger colliders in SDK no longer work",
